    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Parcel Mania is a frantic online or local splitscreen party game supporting up to 4 players in a match. Your #1 goal? Collect and deliver the most parcels and become the best courier connoisseur of the match! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/38097e5ea0394309a61dc207dd9b04dd.poster.avif?t=1701929713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/38097e5ea0394309a61dc207dd9b04dd.webm?t=1701929713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/38097e5ea0394309a61dc207dd9b04dd.mp4?t=1701929713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/18c82776d6aa27b349494f602fd2ec21.avif?t=1701929713\" /></div><br><br>Collect parcels from their stations, or smack \u2018em out of your friends hands. Whoever delivers them to the customers gets to rank up high in the scoreboard. And if you want to slow your friends down? Slap the customers and watch them weep! It\u2019s all fair in the world of delivery.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/d7adb108f7f43db1fa7d0655e6b3ca51.poster.avif?t=1701929713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/d7adb108f7f43db1fa7d0655e6b3ca51.webm?t=1701929713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/d7adb108f7f43db1fa7d0655e6b3ca51.mp4?t=1701929713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/f30e83bd0f139bcf1f6c34f5f3278b15.avif?t=1701929713\" /></div><br><br>Leap over walls, flip switches, zip through shortcuts and defy gravity itself to get your parcels to your customers no matter what. Talk about 'air mail'! In Parcel Mania, you're not just a courier \u2013 you're a gravity-defying delivery superhero. Just remember, capes are optional when you're leaping over walls and flipping through the air!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/9be5b05a9bde8a91dd357278ca1a636f.poster.avif?t=1701929713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/9be5b05a9bde8a91dd357278ca1a636f.webm?t=1701929713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/9be5b05a9bde8a91dd357278ca1a636f.mp4?t=1701929713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/e176b5309e21dbf836c42a1b89817ef7.avif?t=1701929713\" /></div><br><br>Pick from five distinct characters, each with their own quirky personality and style! Each character brings their own unique flair to the frantic parcel delivery action. So, who will you be today? The choice is yours \u2013 pick your favorite and deliver those parcels with style!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/a518225cd95955d0addfec026aa349ff.poster.avif?t=1701929713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/a518225cd95955d0addfec026aa349ff.webm?t=1701929713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/a518225cd95955d0addfec026aa349ff.mp4?t=1701929713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/150232bc4b72c460f95589b8c372cb24.avif?t=1701929713\" /></div><br><br>Setting traps for your friends is like being in a wacky game show \u2013 except the only prize is the sweet, sweet victory of watching them jump in surprise. It's not just about speed, it's about how you play the game \u2013 and a little bit of 'parcel-tactical' warfare!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/3744652b8f595015e74f9625e4b4ac6f.poster.avif?t=1701929713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/3744652b8f595015e74f9625e4b4ac6f.webm?t=1701929713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/3744652b8f595015e74f9625e4b4ac6f.mp4?t=1701929713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/df705498acbca2167e82ac6d6c5c69fc.avif?t=1701929713\" /></div><br><br>Challenge your friends from across the globe or from across your couch \u2013 all for no price. Yep \u2013 Parcel Mania in its current or future versions will remain FREE TO PLAY. Now go get those customers their parcels and beat your friends!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/dc037fbddd5a4228de864de14e98096f.poster.avif?t=1701929713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/dc037fbddd5a4228de864de14e98096f.webm?t=1701929713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142020/extras/dc037fbddd5a4228de864de14e98096f.mp4?t=1701929713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
